{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_907.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"4dd8b0cce2ff69e5065b55ad31b68aae9a5f2482456f2f2eb4c6c3f1ff86dd35","ja":"リーダーとして","zh":"作为队长","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_907.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"84fc95e7c34001015951f5b5d95edefba82f9208d2a33efbd9226aeb34f8514f","ja":"どうしよ～！　このままじゃわたし、\n台本なしで本番に出ることになっちゃいます～！","zh":"怎么办呀～！这样下去，我就要不拿台本上台正式演出了～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_907.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"16156eafd81bf60b80616471aada8ec88c64658cf925e407ea9aa3508c18d7a9","ja":"アタシ、●●●●プロデューサーに聞いてみるよ。\nもしかしたら、台本余ってるかもしれないし。","zh":"我去问问●●●●制作人吧。  \n说不定还有多余的剧本呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_907.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"9139f3146b1814402d6a5e2d505eac1dbc7e935e10cf3ae69ab1f1bad9f495c1","ja":"すみません、恵美さん……。","zh":"对不起，惠美……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_907.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"7c98302abbe8a2154bd65966a87e1d2f937d24cd3be4d75faac9d0972ccd638b","ja":"はぁ……台本、余ってなかったらどうしよう……。","zh":"唉……要是没有多余的剧本，该怎么办……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_907.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"b1d92d5a32fe3695fa68a7e91128aed6893e4698ad8cf1d139ff63fa5344bae9","ja":"はいほー！　遅くなってしまったのです！　……おや？\n翼ちゃん、困った顔をしてどうしたのです？","zh":"嗨呼——！不小心来晚了！……咦？翼，你怎么一脸为难，是怎么了？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_907.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"0754180bd68345a4e743e65e432472e81c6faa1e0d5ed2b2d8202465447e5843","ja":"まつりさん、貴音さん！　その……実はわたし、\n朗読劇で使う台本を、家に忘れてきちゃって……。","zh":"茉莉小姐、贵音小姐！那个……其实我，把朗读剧要用的剧本忘在家里了……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_907.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"5712b62338942378541069fb38852aad24442921d26145e564b582f1cb08bd0b","ja":"なんと、それは一大事ですね。","zh":"没想到，竟然是件大事呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_907.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"9dd236ada3bb65064c807f257587e35cd2219037d18d061f147a3f01ecd5cb57","ja":"ううっ……なんでカバンに入れなかったんだろう～！\n台本読んだ後、すぐに片付けとけばよかった……。","zh":"呜呜……我当时怎么没把它放进包里啊～！\n看完剧本后，要是马上收拾好就好了……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_907.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"a2589674733754cb33623eb7a2fc40287a9766e5a4fc397eaf9d3e266f84f7b2","ja":"ほ？　翼ちゃん……\nひょっとして、お家で練習してたのです？","zh":"咦？翼……你该不会是在家里练习了吧？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_907.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"2f63e3f100d3eb34bbf7e57b3e8fcaa7335f3c8413419474e21760350b0042bf","ja":"はい……。だってわたし、ユニットのリーダーだし、\n完璧に仕上げておかなきゃって思って……。","zh":"是的……因为我毕竟是组合的队长，所以想着一定要准备得万无一失……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_907.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"2401f73cdf6366c8a3685326c76d91929c485c0ae7dda0efa720d3dfa1c30bd8","ja":"そういうことでしたか。でしたら……\n翼、本当に台本がないとできないのでしょうか？","zh":"原来是这样。既然如此……\n\n翼，真的没有剧本就做不到吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_907.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"af7ff8ade8b5bea5aba56b5c229b40474e95624f31a34bce332fdab61fbbdf50","ja":"そうなのです。試しに、\n今から姫たちと読み合わせをしてみるのですよ！","zh":"没错。接下来就和公主们一起试着对台词吧！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_907.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"cab8d20d4f476b3a58986f7381000e822b2e3c0c789b2fb34115a16b399ac8d0","ja":"……え～っ？　台本なしでですか～！？","zh":"……诶～？不看台本就要来吗～！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
